# Framed mockups after admin save

New posters are composited by `.github/workflows/framed-mockup.yml`, not by the Cloudflare Worker.

- Triggers on `main` when `posters.json` or `images/*` changes (admin add).
- Runs `python scripts/composite-leaning-frame.py --missing-only` (skip existing JPEGs; do not rerun on reorder/rename).
- Updates that poster’s `gallery`, regenerates SEO pages, commits with `[skip ci]`.
- Do not port the Pillow compositor into the Worker.
- Admin has no replace-image flow; `--missing-only` will not refresh a framed JPEG if the artwork file is replaced in place.

Local full rebuild: `.venv/bin/python3 scripts/composite-leaning-frame.py`  
Manual Action run: **Actions** → **Framed mockups** → **Run workflow**.
